---
// src/components/Footer.astro
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-zinc-950 text-zinc-400 pt-16 pb-12 border-t border-zinc-900">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">

    <!-- Top Footer: Logo e Colonne Link -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 pb-12 border-b border-zinc-900">
      
      <!-- Colonna Brand (5 col) -->
      <div class="col-span-2 md:col-span-5 space-y-4">
        <a href="/" class="inline-block">
          <img 
            src="/images/logo-digiscon.png" 
            alt="Digiscon" 
            class="h-8 w-auto brightness-0 invert" 
          />
        </a>
        <p class="text-sm text-zinc-400 font-normal leading-relaxed max-w-sm">
          La cassa telematica su smartphone e tablet. Emetti corrispettivi e scontrini a norma di legge senza registratore fisico né verifiche periodiche.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 pt-2 font-mono">
          Compatibile con cassetto fiscale Agenzia delle Entrate (DCO)
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Colonna Prodotto (2 col) -->
      <div class="col-span-1 md:col-span-2 space-y-3">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-200">Prodotto</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm font-medium">
          <li><a href="#come-funziona" class="hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Come Funziona</a></li>
          <li><a href="#funzionalita" class="hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Funzionalità</a></li>
          <li><a href="#attivita" class="hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Settori</a></li>
          <li><a href="#confronto" class="hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Perché Digiscon</a></li>
          <li><a href="#prezzi" class="hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Piani e Prezzi</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Colonna Integrazioni (2 col) -->
      <div class="col-span-1 md:col-span-2 space-y-3">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-200">Integrazioni</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm font-medium">
          <li><a href="#sumup" class="hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">POS SumUp & Nexi</a></li>
          <li><a href="#stampanti" class="hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Stampanti Bluetooth</a></li>
          <li><a href="#whatsapp" class="hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Scontrino WhatsApp</a></li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://negozioeasy.it" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-orange-400 hover:text-orange-300 transition-colors font-bold flex items-center gap-1">
              Negozio Easy
              <svg class="w-3 h-3" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Colonna Assistenza & Contatti (3 col) -->
      <div class="col-span-2 md:col-span-3 space-y-3">
        <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-200">Supporto</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm font-medium">
          <li><a href="#faq" class="hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Domande Frequenti</a></li>
          <li><a href="mailto:supporto@digiscon.it" class="hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">supporto@digiscon.it</a></li>
          <li class="text-xs text-zinc-400 pt-2">
            Assistenza tecnica attiva dal Lunedì al Venerdì (9:00 - 18:00)
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Bar: Dati societari reali & Copyright -->
    <div class="pt-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-zinc-400 font-normal">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-center md:text-left">
        <span>© {currentYear} Digiscon. Tutti i diritti riservati.</span>
        <span>P.IVA / C.F. in fase di attivazione</span>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
        <a href="/privacy" class="hover:text-zinc-300 transition-colors">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/cookie" class="hover:text-zinc-300 transition-colors">Cookie Policy</a>
        <a href="/termini" class="hover:text-zinc-300 transition-colors">Termini di Servizio</a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</footer>
